# A command claude's sandbox stops: a write into the worktree's admin directory, which orca-term's
# settings deny. The command fails and the turn still finishes, as in
# tests/fixtures/claude-hooks/tui-sandbox-*.log, and the file must not exist afterwards: this is
# the real boundary of claude's sandbox with the settings orca-term writes. One prompt.
agent claude-code
recording tui-sandbox
timeout 180
expect finished
check-missing {{denied}}/from-bash.txt

sleep 5
press down
press enter
wait-for SessionStart
sleep 2
type run exactly this shell command and nothing else, then reply with the single word ok: touch {{denied}}/from-bash.txt
press enter
wait-for Stop
